  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p><strong>Prerequisites:</strong> Enhancement sphere (Animate Object (enhance)), ability to acquire a familiar.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> When choosing a new familiar, you may select a Tiny animated object in place of a normal creature. An object familiar’s type does not change, and it does not gain the ability to speak to other creatures of its kind.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may apply the benefits of any feats that improve your use of Animate Object to your animated object familiar. If you later take Improved Familiar, you may select a Small animated object at 5th caster level instead.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/enhancement#toc83\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
